    "abstract": "This standard specifies an interface format for the transport of MPEG-2 AAC/HE AAC data rate reduced audio streams contained in the ADTS wrapper and placed into an AES3 serial digital audio stream. This Standard supports the MPEG-2 AAC LC Profile, with or without the use of the SBR tools. This Standard is limited to carriage of a single audio elementary stream.",
